{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-binghatti-orchid","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"binghatti-orchid","about":"Situated at the core of a bustling cityscape, Binghatti Orchid stands as a beacon of luxury and reprieve. Drawing inspiration from the refined beauty and poise of the orchid flower, this distinguished property unfolds as a true masterpiece in architectural brilliance, resonating with peace and calmness at every corner.Every facet of the building, down to its thoughtfully conceived balcony design, not only offers residents a personal slice of outdoor paradise but also champions sustainability. The intelligent construction optimizes shade, significantly reducing the energy demands for cooling the interiors, thereby blending indulgence with eco-conscious living.Choose from an array of living spaces, including modern studios and one or two-bedroom apartments, each promising a home where elegance meets convenience, and where every day invites you to live in a harmony of luxury and nature's grace. Discover your haven of opulence and comfort at Binghatti Orchid.","price":640000,"title":"Binghatti Orchid","bitrix":{"id":201,"pf_id":"are.2.13030","source":null,"project_id":"Binghatti Orchid","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Binghatti - Orchid","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Binghatti","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/binghatti_orchid_feature_50448e1ddc.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/binghatti_orchid_feature_50448e1ddc.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0612762,"lng":55.1976292},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/binghatti_orchid_7_24191e4371.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/binghatti_orchid_7_24191e4371.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cl